{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Currently in development;</strong> Engines of Destruction is a next generation mech simulator, playble in PvP, Co-op and singleplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/Features.png?t=1739798330\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pilot enormous mechs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the cockpit of giant fighting machines, customise them with a wide choice of weapons, equipment, paintjobs and more. Blow enemies away with per module damage systems and use your radar for weapon targeting, enemy unit detecting and identifying friend from foe. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1739798330\" />Playable on VR and Desktop </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">EOD is fully playable in PCVR and on desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1739798330\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gamemodes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play in several different gamemodes, against other players or the onslaughting waves of AI enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1739798330\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customise your mech</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mechs also feature a large amount of customisation, all weapon systems can be switched out. They can also be fitted with smoke grenade launchers, additional armour, bigger reactions, rocket thrusters and much much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/mechspin.gif?t=1739798330\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create Gamemode in the Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a level editor allowing the creation of new user generated gamemodes and missions.  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1937070?t=1739798330","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739798330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739798330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739798330","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Violence, No depicition of Blood/Gore"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Currently in development;</strong> Engines of Destruction is a next generation mech simulator, playble in PvP, Co-op and singleplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/Features.png?t=1739798330\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pilot enormous mechs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the cockpit of giant fighting machines, customise them with a wide choice of weapons, equipment, paintjobs and more. Blow enemies away with per module damage systems and use your radar for weapon targeting, enemy unit detecting and identifying friend from foe. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1739798330\" />Playable on VR and Desktop </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">EOD is fully playable in PCVR and on desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1739798330\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gamemodes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play in several different gamemodes, against other players or the onslaughting waves of AI enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1739798330\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customise your mech</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mechs also feature a large amount of customisation, all weapon systems can be switched out. They can also be fitted with smoke grenade launchers, additional armour, bigger reactions, rocket thrusters and much much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/extras/mechspin.gif?t=1739798330\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create Gamemode in the Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a level editor allowing the creation of new user generated gamemodes and missions.  </p>","developers":["ReEngage Developments Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937070/header.jpg?t=1739798330","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257079946,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2570